WEBVTT

00:02:58.474 --> 00:03:01.889
Greta Thunberg is a teenager
who first started striking for climate.

00:03:02.252 --> 00:03:04.642
Her boldness inspired me,

00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:07.555
and I was shocked by the realization

00:03:07.579 --> 00:03:11.598
that youth could turn
public opinion on social issues.

00:03:12.196 --> 00:03:13.347
The movement exploded.

00:03:13.371 --> 00:03:14.713
(Video) Crowd: Shut it down!

00:03:14.737 --> 00:03:16.785
XB: And I became
one of the main organizers

00:03:16.809 --> 00:03:19.431
for New York, the US and the world.

00:03:19.455 --> 00:03:21.907
(Video) XB: What do we want?
Crowd: Climate justice!

00:03:21.931 --> 00:03:23.556
XB: When do we want it?
Crowd: Now!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.880
XB: I started speaking up about
climate justice and Indigenous rights

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.980
and intergenerational cooperation.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.117
That was only the beginning, though.